(D4 — Discrepancy 4 repro: a `file` parameter's `readable` and `writable`
 properties are always false. A handle opened for reading reports
 readable 1 at top level and 0 through a parameter; a handle opened for
 writing reports writable 1 at top level and 0 through a parameter.
 `size` and `descriptor` are correct through the same parameter, so it is
 these two boolean properties specifically. LANGUAGE.md:745 says "file
 parameters support file properties".
