)
To 'read flags of' with a file called handle.
  Print handle's readable.
  Print handle's writable.

open a file for reading called src at "docs/ledger/probes/functions/fixtures/data.txt".
open a file for writing called sink at "/tmp/vox-fun-d4.txt".

Print "top level, opened for reading:".
Print src's readable.
Print src's writable.
Print "top level, opened for writing:".
Print sink's readable.
Print sink's writable.
Print "through a parameter, opened for reading:".
'read flags of' of src.
Print "through a parameter, opened for writing:".
